for ob__co_idx_v0, (resid1_tile__co_l0_iter_v1,) in pl.parallel(10, init_values=(resid1_tile__ssa_v0,)):
    resid1_tile__co_l1_rv_v1: pl.Tensor[[16, 5120], pl.FP32, pl.MemRef(-1, 327680, 9)] = self.scope3_incore_0(attn_out__ssa_v0, b0__idx_v0, hidden_states__ssa_v0, ob__co_idx_v0, resid1_tile__co_l0_iter_v1, wo__ssa_v0)
    resid1_tile__co_l0_rv_v1: pl.Tensor[[16, 5120], pl.FP32, pl.MemRef(-1, 327680, 10)] = pl.yield_(resid1_tile__co_l1_rv_v1)
``` 

### Expected Behavior

The generated orchestration should create the tensor once before the loop and pass it as add_inout to each iteration, so all 10 chunks write into the same buffer:
```cpp
